{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15249","headline":"府试古镜 · 李益","name":"府试古镜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧是秦时镜，今藏古匣中。\n龙盘初挂月，凤舞欲生风。\n石黛曾留殿，朱光适在宫。\n应祥知道泰，监物觉神通。\n肝胆诚难隐，妍媸信易穷。\n幸居君子室，长愿免尘蒙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}